# ── Baseline-commit additions ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated apps. This is agent OUTPUT, not source: 63 projects, and the source
# of the three worth keeping is already on GitHub. Committing ~30k generated
# files would make every `git status` slow on a OneDrive-synced tree for no
# safety gain — the code this repo exists to protect is everything else.
production-ready/

# A 482 MB archive of unverified contents, sitting next to the tree it claims
# to back up. Not source, and not something to carry in history.
*.rar

# ── AgentForge ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
